  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074602/description_670c44a4-aa1a-411f-bbfc-4a5fec532b04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"247\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">正在製作中！</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🪑&nbsp;關於 🪑</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Furniture Beetle 是一款專注於為原版遊戲增添內容的模組。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過家具體驗全新的 Vanilla+ 樂趣。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GZiVFXv.png\" alt=\"barra2\" width=\"2063\" height=\"51\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔧 未來更新 🔧</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">讓烤箱能夠正常使用</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂介面</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">家具提供多種顏色變化</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多原版風格家具&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">回饋與建議&nbsp;<span>非常歡迎 😊</span></span></p>",
